<%- uk_import_measures = uk_declarable&.import_measures %>

<p>Import VAT is separate from customs duty and may still be due when the customs duty rate is 0%. If more than one VAT rate is shown, the rate that applies depends on the goods and any relevant conditions.</p>

<% if uk_import_measures.excise.any? %>
  <p><%= excise_message(uk_import_measures, segmented_commodity_code(declarable_code)) %></p>
<% end %>
